// CDLMORNINGSTAR recognizes the Morning Star pattern over bars startIdx through
// endIdx.
//
// A three-candle bottom-reversal pattern: a long black candle, a small-bodied
// star gapping down, then a white candle closing well up into the first
// candle's body. Bullish reversal signal. A hit signals a bullish reversal
// (most meaningful after a downtrend, which the code does not check).
//
// Formula and more info at https://ta-lib.org/functions/cdlmorningstar.
//
// Inputs, each at least endIdx+1 long:
//   - inOpen: Open price of each bar.
//   - inHigh: High price of each bar.
//   - inLow: Low price of each bar.
//   - inClose: Close price of each bar.
//
// Parameters:
//   - optInPenetration: Fraction of the 1st candle's body the 3rd close must
//     exceed above the 1st close; larger = deeper penetration required. Default
//     0.3; minimum 0; RealDefault selects the default.
//
// Outputs, each at least as long as the values written (the input length always
// suffices):
//   - outInteger: +100 when the morning star is detected, 0 otherwise. Never
//     negative (pattern is exclusively bullish)
